  "contentHtml": "<div class=\"se-viewer se-theme-default\" lang=\"ko-KR\">\n    <!-- SE_DOC_HEADER_START -->\n    <!--@CONTENTS_HEADER-->\n    <!-- SE_DOC_HEADER_END -->\n    <div class=\"se-main-container\">\n                <div class=\"se-component se-text se-l-default\" id=\"SE-f450127a-0616-11ef-9b68-dffbc5072760\">\n                    <div class=\"se-component-content\">\n                        <div class=\"se-section se-section-text se-l-default\">\n                            <div class=\"se-module se-module-text\">\n                                    <!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-f450127b-0616-11ef-9b68-d9eaae368f2b\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-acdcfcad-0618-11ef-9b68-773e538197d8\">오늘은 정말 아무 것도 하기 싫었어요. 어떤 일이 있었던 건 아니예요. 아무 일도 없어서 아무 것도 하기 싫었어요. </span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-acdcfc67-0618-11ef-9b68-a9a12d8e9bf7\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-acdcfcae-0618-11ef-9b68-9b3b05e479c8\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-acdcfc69-0618-11ef-9b68-cfc6f2760b4d\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-acdcfcaf-0618-11ef-9b68-f5c1502a724d\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-acdcfc6b-0618-11ef-9b68-478b02d898c2\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-acdcfcb0-0618-11ef-9b68-7d868a9b258b\">이런 날이 두달에 한번 정도는 오는데요. 근데 저는 이런 날이면 꼭 아무거나 하는 편이예요. 이런 날에는 꼭 하려고 했던걸 어떻게든 하는 편이예요. </span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-acdcfc6d-0618-11ef-9b68-e3202bf4210f\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-acdcfcb1-0618-11ef-9b68-ef6644137767\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-acdcfc6f-0618-11ef-9b68-9d404c2430ff\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-acdcfcb2-0618-11ef-9b68-0b817689592c\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-acdcfc71-0618-11ef-9b68-f93a582f1677\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-acdcfcb3-0618-11ef-9b68-ef912161c3ba\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-acdcfc73-0618-11ef-9b68-f3b0158ab0be\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-acdcfcb4-0618-11ef-9b68-2788d47b2a7b\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-acdcfc75-0618-11ef-9b68-eb92f327dfcf\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-acdcfcb5-0618-11ef-9b68-33cd70be7b3b\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-acdcfc77-0618-11ef-9b68-07982ef79ea1\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-acdcfcb6-0618-11ef-9b68-d319bdf45bd8\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-acdcfc79-0618-11ef-9b68-cddffd3473ae\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-acdd23c7-0618-11ef-9b68-89f809e8144b\">제가 아이들 가르치면서 느낀건데요. 공부 잘하는 애들은 남들이 많이 할 때 더 많이 하는 애들이 아니구요. 남들이 안할 때 좀 &#x27;덜&#x27; 안하는 애들이더라구요. 뭐라도 조금 하는거죠. </span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-acdcfc7b-0618-11ef-9b68-7de8b6d498f2\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-acdd23c8-0618-11ef-9b68-efbb8fefc4ad\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-acdcfc7d-0618-11ef-9b68-27894b5fc17c\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-acdd23c9-0618-11ef-9b68-ebe2d8100cb7\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-acdcfc7f-0618-11ef-9b68-697898a8d51e\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-acdd23ca-0618-11ef-9b68-7f4c929096c9\">그래서 저는 아무 것도 하기 싫은 날에 좀 &#x27;덜&#x27; 안해요. 아무 것도 하기 싫은 날에는 아무거나 해요. </span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-acdcfc81-0618-11ef-9b68-a119e5a09ca3\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-acdd23cb-0618-11ef-9b68-21644db2c6ea\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-acdcfc83-0618-11ef-9b68-9fdee1edee63\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-acdd23cc-0618-11ef-9b68-dfa542919536\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-acdcfc85-0618-11ef-9b68-9bf8b82fd950\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-acdd23cd-0618-11ef-9b68-a5a1c642f8fd\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-acdcfc87-0618-11ef-9b68-2f0e5398d0f6\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-acdd23ce-0618-11ef-9b68-59cac416e6a0\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-acdcfc89-0618-11ef-9b68-e908da0a3481\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-acdd23cf-0618-11ef-9b68-3136fd89d54b\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-acdcfc8b-0618-11ef-9b68-31331f7709be\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-acdd23d0-0618-11ef-9b68-43e45c922fae\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-acdcfc8d-0618-11ef-9b68-8fdead88219e\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-acdd23d1-0618-11ef-9b68-a1c9b0af65b2\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-acdcfc8f-0618-11ef-9b68-339aec85a520\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-acdd23d2-0618-11ef-9b68-77db58903e63\">오늘 진짜 일 하기 싫어서 사무실에 조금 늦게 갔어요. 그래도 하려던 일은 꾸역꾸역 다했어요.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-acdcfc91-0618-11ef-9b68-172441ee37ba\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-acdd23d3-0618-11ef-9b68-a35af6714c64\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-acdcfc93-0618-11ef-9b68-1df14918d4f1\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-acdd23d4-0618-11ef-9b68-012fc3a855a0\">오늘 진짜 운동하기 싫어서 아침에 러닝 안했어요. 그래도 유산소는 하려고 지금 풋살 하러 왔어요. </span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-acdcfc95-0618-11ef-9b68-b71b2c215256\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-acdd23d5-0618-11ef-9b68-ebf0780187db\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-acdcfc97-0618-11ef-9b68-ff204a2c76cd\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-acdd23d6-0618-11ef-9b68-cbb0f4b8c675\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT -->\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>                <div class=\"se-component se-image se-l-default\" id=\"SE-a4ea60d0-0618-11ef-9b68-1943f6a42f20\">\n                    <div class=\"se-component-content se-component-content-extend\">\n                        <div class=\"se-section se-section-image se-l-default